‹Heading2,b:Step 1: walk the›
‹Heading2,b:output folder›

  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Write the
    failing test in
    ‹Code: internal/check/›
    ‹Code:walk_test.go ›
    ‹Bullet:1. ›Build a
       folder with
       three pages
       and a symlink
       in
       ‹Code: t.TempDir() ›
    ‹Bullet:2. ›Assert the
       walker
       returns the
       three pages,
       sorted
    ‹Bullet:3. ›Run it and
       watch it
       fail:
       ‹CodeFrame:╭─ ›‹CodeLang:sh›‹CodeFrame: ──────╮›
       ‹CodeFrame:│ ›‹LineNumber:1 ›‹CodeText:go tes…›‹CodeFrame: │›
       ‹CodeFrame:╰───────────╯›
       Expected:
       ‹Code: undefined:›
       ‹Code:Walk ›
