‹Heading2,b:Step 2: extract›
‹Heading2,b:links›

  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Test the
    extractor on a
    page with every
    link shape
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›plain ‹Code: <a›
      ‹Code:href> › and
      ‹Code: <img src> ›
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›a link with a
      fragment only
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›a link with a
      query string
      and a fragment
      ‹Bullet:▪ ›the query is
        ignored when
        the file is
        looked up
      ‹Bullet:▪ ›the fragment
        is checked
        against the
        target page
        ‹Bullet:▪ ›a missing
          anchor is
          a finding,
          a missing
          file is
          another
  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Implement it,
    then run ‹Code: make›
    ‹Code:check ›
  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Commit

