‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:Keep the reporter›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:free of colour:›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:the CI log is›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:plain text.›

‹Heading2,b:Notes›

  ‹Bullet:1. ›Do not follow
     redirects, a
     redirect page
     is a finding
     too
  ‹Bullet:2. ›Cap the walk at
     100,000 pages
  ‹Bullet:3. ›Never write
     into the output
     folder
